      "notes": "Masons energy is contagious and genuine.  He needs to maintain that through presentation.  There were a few things that stood out regarding technique.  1.  During presentation, an option was presented for a water softener as “we are at $5,000 but we’re not the cheapest”.  Basically talked himself out of a sale right there or at least invited her to shop around with that phrasing.  2.  Forgot to have customer sign the form stating that we had been there, and offerered a 5 star experience.  I want to make sure that we are deliberate in our core principles.  3.  Misdiagnosed leak in basement and was prepared to have a new water line ran out to Lampeter.  The problem was a valve at the refrigerator causing a leak which I diagnosed.  Slow down and look at the entire problem from beginning of the chain on down to the problem.  Overall, great guy and I have high hopes for him."
